  <style>
    {%- comment -%} Surface must come from the colour grammar. This band was the ONLY place in
      the 2026 estate painting a band with --bbc-cream (#faf7f0) — a fifth light tone next to
      the canonical four Impact uses (paper #F1E9D8, bone #E6DCC8, forest, steel). Measured
      2026-08-03: the homepage rendered 6 distinct band surfaces against Impact's 4, and this
      was the odd one. It was fragile as well as off-palette — --bbc-cream is declared twice
      with different values (#faf7f0 in bbc-aaa-2026.css, #f8fafc in bbc-foundation.css), so
      the band's colour depended on which sheet won. --paper is the documented light surface.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    .bbc-rd-home .acc{ background:var(--paper,#F1E9D8); }
    .bbc-rd-home .acc-head{ max-width:60ch; }
